{
  "theme": {
    "pitch": "Megadungeon - a classic roguelike drawn as an isometric pixel-art view. A lone delver goes down from a surface village into a 100-level megadungeon of 13 themes (cellars and crypts, goblin warrens, flooded sewers, old mines, ruined temples, fungal caverns, dwarven holds, catacombs, a wizard's sanctum, an underdark lake, lava forges, void halls, the Abyssal Throne), fights by dice in tight rooms, and carries treasure back up, because only banked treasure counts. The dungeon is old, indifferent and slightly wrong; it is never cute. The text panes around the view stay CP437 text, so the art sits inside a black, text-mode frame.",
