  "rules": {
    "do": [
      "keep floors low in contrast so creatures stand out",
      "keep a creature's colour token its dominant hue, so recoloured family sprites read like the text display's colours",
      "read every creature's facing and silhouette at 1x against a dark floor",
      "draw to the size table: a rat below the knee, an ogre twice the player's height",
      "give every class its own silhouette: what covers the body (plate, doublet, robe, pelt, cloak), what crowns the head (helm, hat, bare scalp, hood, mask) and what the hands hold",
      "draw people with human, egg-shaped heads (round cranium, narrower jaw, a neck) and organic curved bodies; arms bend at the elbow"
    ],
    "dont": [
      "cute or chibi proportions",
      "saturated greens or purples on floors",
      "pure black fills",
      "light that implies a torch the game does not have",
      "square or boxy bodies, heads and robes"
    ]
